  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-Annual Programme Estimate Technical Cooperation Facility V</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Multiannual Programme Estimate contributes to achieve the objectives of the Financing Agreement SL/FED/039-738 &apos;Technical Cooperation Facility V &apos;. Overall goal is to support the Government of Sierra Leone in defining specific actions under the NIP and ensuring the effective preparation and implementation of development programmes. This programme estimate will involve training support and participation in conferences and seminars, and it will help improve the visibility of EU interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
